🌐 Project Task: Smart Internship Portal with AI Recommendations
🎯 Objective
Develop a responsive web application that lists internship opportunities and uses AI/ML to provide personalized recommendations based on user profiles.
🔹 Core Web Development Responsibilities
1. Frontend Development
Build a clean, responsive UI using React.js (or Next.js).
Features:
Internship listings with title, company, domain, duration, and apply link.
Search and filter options (domain, duration, location).
User authentication (Login/Signup) with JWT.
Profile page for users to add skills and interests.
2. Backend Development
Use Node.js + Express for server-side logic.
Database: MongoDB (or PostgreSQL).
Create REST APIs for:
Internship CRUD operations.
User profile management.
Recommendation engine integration.
3. Deployment
Deploy the application on Vercel/Render/InfinityFree.
Integrate a custom domain.
Ensure SSL certificate for secure access.
🔹 AI/ML Integration
1. Recommendation Engine
Collect user skills and interests from their profile.
Implement a simple ML model (e.g., scikit-learn, TensorFlow Lite, or even a rule-based system) to suggest internships.
Example: If a user has “React + Node.js” skills, prioritize internships in Web Development.
2. Chatbot Assistant (Optional but Valuable)
Integrate a basic NLP chatbot using Dialogflow or Rasa.
Chatbot asks: “Which domain are you interested in?” and suggests relevant internships.
3. Analytics Dashboard
Track popular domains and most-applied internships.
Visualize data using Chart.js or D3.js.
🔹 Deliverables
Functional Web App with login, internship listings, and AI-powered recommendations.
